<a href="https://github.com/joeyf116/amp-gpui/releases">github.com/joeyf116/amp-gpui/releases</a>.</p>
<p>ASIO is a registered trademark of Steinberg Media Technologies GmbH. Amp GPUI uses
the Steinberg ASIO SDK under GPLv3, and each release includes the SDK source it was
